   - TRPCProvider
   - QueryClientProvider
   - TooltipProvider
3. Created basic mock instances for required services (i18n, queryClient)
4. Kept the necessary component mocks
5. Simplified the overall structure

The providers are added in the same order as they appear in the error stack trace, which should match the expected context hierarchy. This should resolve the module fetching error by providing all the required context providers that the component needs to render properly.

